WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.269
Vinnie and Mandy were put into the other carriage, under guard.

2
00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:16.814
The guard was too frightened to hold the glowing photo.

3
00:00:16.815 --> 00:00:19.938
He gave it back to Vinnie.

4
00:00:19.939 --> 00:00:24.146
"Witches," the guard said under his breath.

5
00:00:24.147 --> 00:00:27.068
"We're not!" cried Vinnie.

6
00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:33.143
As they rode, Vinnie told Mandy all about Edward and the tailor shop.

7
00:00:33.144 --> 00:00:37.894
"I didn't even get to say good-bye," Vinnie said sadly.

8
00:00:37.895 --> 00:00:40.901
Mandy told him about Lady Katherine.

9
00:00:40.902 --> 00:00:44.068
"She was nice to me," she said.

10
00:00:44.069 --> 00:00:47.096
"But she wanted me to be her servant.

11
00:00:47.097 --> 00:00:49.213
I didn't like that."

12
00:00:49.214 --> 00:00:52.471
Mandy looked through the carriage window.

13
00:00:52.472 --> 00:00:55.614
They were crossing a long bridge.

14
00:00:55.615 --> 00:01:01.151
She could see a stone building with many towers in the distance.

15
00:01:01.152 --> 00:01:04.884
"What's that?" Vinnie asked, pointing.

16
00:01:04.885 --> 00:01:09.472
"The whole area is called the Tower of London," said the guard.

17
00:01:09.473 --> 00:01:11.840
"The queen lives in the White Tower.

18
00:01:11.841 --> 00:01:14.211
But you're going to the Bell Tower."

19
00:01:14.212 --> 00:01:17.141
"What's in there?" asked Vinnie.

20
00:01:17.142 --> 00:01:20.136
"It's a prison," replied the guard.

21
00:01:20.137 --> 00:01:23.216
"The queen will decide what to do with you later."

22
00:01:23.217 --> 00:01:26.410
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other.

23
00:01:26.411 --> 00:01:31.666
"Prison?" Vinnie whispered. "We're going to prison?"

24
00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:35.066
"Why?" asked Mandy.

25
00:01:35.067 --> 00:01:36.881
The carriage stopped.

26
00:01:36.882 --> 00:01:40.281
The guard pulled the children from the carriage.

27
00:01:40.282 --> 00:01:43.933
Queen Elizabeth's carriage pulled up slowly.

28
00:01:43.934 --> 00:01:48.601
The queen got out and walked over to the children.

29
00:01:48.602 --> 00:01:53.417
"I am not a cruel woman," she said to them.

30
00:01:53.418 --> 00:01:58.875
"However, I will not permit witchcraft in my kingdom."

31
00:01:58.876 --> 00:02:02.805
"But we're not witches," began Vinnie.

32
00:02:02.806 --> 00:02:05.868
"Silence!" cried the Queen.

33
00:02:05.869 --> 00:02:09.554
Then she asked, "Where are your parents?

34
00:02:09.555 --> 00:02:12.145
Are they witches too?"

35
00:02:12.146 --> 00:02:15.411
Vinnie and Mandy did not answer.

36
00:02:15.412 --> 00:02:19.134
"Witchcraft is against the law in England.

37
00:02:19.135 --> 00:02:26.219
I have no choice but to send you to the Bell Tower," Queen Elizabeth said.

38
00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:29.555
Two guards grabbed the children.

39
00:02:29.556 --> 00:02:33.641
"Let go of me!" Vinnie yelled.

40
00:02:33.642 --> 00:02:38.750
Suddenly, the birds in the trees flew into the sky.

41
00:02:38.751 --> 00:02:44.678
"Vinnie! Look!" Mandy pointed to the large black birds.

42
00:02:44.679 --> 00:02:48.405
"The photo had black birds in it!"

43
00:02:48.406 --> 00:02:50.697
Vinnie took the photo out.

44
00:02:50.698 --> 00:02:53.544
The picture was glowing blue.

45
00:02:53.545 --> 00:02:58.419
"The tower ravens have been here for many years," said one guard.

46
00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:01.544
"You will get used to them!"

47
00:03:01.545 --> 00:03:09.440
Right after that, a group of men in black hats and red uniforms marched up to Vinnie and Mandy.

48
00:03:09.441 --> 00:03:12.174
They carried long spears.

49
00:03:12.175 --> 00:03:17.081
"Take these children to the tower!" shouted the queen.

50
00:03:17.082 --> 00:03:20.487
"Look, Mandy!" cried Vinnie.

51
00:03:20.488 --> 00:03:24.206
"That's it!" Mandy said excitedly.

52
00:03:24.207 --> 00:03:29.501
"The ravens and the spears are in the photo!"

53
00:03:29.502 --> 00:03:34.084
Vinnie noticed the spears in the photo were glowing red.

54
00:03:34.085 --> 00:03:42.423
The children closed their eyes and fell into the deep dark tunnel.

55
00:03:42.424 --> 00:03:48.016
Back in the attic, Vinnie and Mandy let out a sigh of relief.

56
00:03:48.017 --> 00:03:56.397
It was good to be home.
